  "Scope": "Fixed cc5fb784 -\u003E5770b86c. Fourteen equal-result public Core cases: ten before/after Count or IsMatch controls/ASCII/Unicode hit/miss/compiled/NB/finite/live token rows, four existing caller-destination before/after controls plus new funded-owner destination lanes. New funded APIs have no funded baseline; their cost is a feature observation against existing unfunded live-token APIs, not a claimed funded speedup/regression. No host conversion added. Cold32 same-size distinct template keys have identical expansions, so every stored destination remains invariant and full contents can be checked after timing without per-call snapshots. Complete operations include native preparation, matching/output and synchronous refunds; setup/compilation excluded. Lightweight atomic host counters are used for program and working admission. Warm1.5s/min1000calls/lane, independent80ms calibration,3alternating samples,all\u003E=20ms. One120s cap; at most one focused noise confirmation. No catalog/cumulative/package claim.",
